1. Permissions

   Subject to section 2, you may:

   1.1 View and read the source code.
   1.2 Play the Software: download, install and run it for personal use and on
       servers, including monetized servers.
   1.3 Include it in modpacks, including public modpacks, provided the
       Software's files are obtained and distributed through an official
       distribution platform or its API (e.g. Modrinth, CurseForge) so that
       downloads are attributed to the Author's project page, and the modpack
       credits or links to the original project.
   1.4 Make private modifications for your own use that are not shared with
       others.
   1.5 Record, stream and publish videos and screenshots of the Software.

